## Styler

What to test:

- Confirm each radius key picks up its styler fill, stroke and dash settings.
- Confirm the series-level `fill` is overridden by the styler return value.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Styler" name="styler" type="generated" /%}

## Styler & Item Styler

What to test:

- Confirm series styling applies to all segments and the item styler overrides only the targeted quarters.
- Confirm item-styler overrides compose with the base styler (fields not returned fall through).

{% chartExampleRunner title="Styler & Item Styler" name="styler-and-itemstyler" type="generated" /%}

## Styler Highlight State

What to test:

- Hover a segment and confirm `highlighted-item` and `unhighlighted-item` styles apply to that series.
- Hover the legend entry and confirm `highlighted-series` and `unhighlighted-series` styles apply across segments.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Styler Highlight State" name="styler-highlight-state" type="generated" /%}
